#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "632\t720"
msgid "Oh, sorry! I must've dozed off."
msgstr "¡Oh, lo siento! Me quedé dormida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "747\t852"
msgid "I was laid out here the whole time?"
msgstr "¿Estuve durmiendo aquí todo este tiempo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "868\t995"
msgid "Yeah. Are you feeling any better, Suzuki-san?"
msgstr "Sí. ¿Te sientes mejor, Suzuki-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1026\t1086"
msgid "Suzuki?"
msgstr "¿Suzuki?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1093\t1153"
msgid "Oh, yeah."
msgstr "Sí..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1184\t1236"
msgid "Where's Kiryu-han?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está Kiryu-han?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1237\t1376"
msgid "You mean Uncle Kaz?\\nHe's out shopping."
msgstr "Oh, ¿el tío Kaz?\\nEstá de compras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1369\t1496"
msgid "He said we should fix you\\nsomething to help you recover."
msgstr "Pensó que sería buena idea alimentarte bien\\npara ayudarte con tu recuperación."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1558\t1618"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1628\t1688"
msgid "Oh yeah."
msgstr "Oh, por cierto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2059\t2120"
msgid "Here we... go!"
msgstr "Ya... casi."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2132\t2192"
msgid "Phew, that was heavy."
msgstr "Uf, que pesado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2206\t2266"
msgid "Here's your bag."
msgstr "Aquí tienes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2297\t2363"
msgid "It's yours, right, Suzuki-san?"
msgstr "Esto es tuyo, ¿verdad, Suzuki-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2368\t2463"
msgid "Uncle Kaz said to give it to you\\nwhen you woke up."
msgstr "El Tío Kaz dijo que te lo diera\\ncuando despertaras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2842\t2952"
msgid "He told me he found it on the beach."
msgstr "Al parecer lo encontró en la playa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2950\t3040"
msgid "You're the only one it could belong to."
msgstr "Seguramente te pertenece."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3736\t3819"
msgid "What's wrong, Suzuki-san?\\nAre you okay?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa, Suzuki-san?\\n¿Estás bien?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3824\t3939"
msgid "Huh? Yeah... I'm good."
msgstr "¿Uh? Sí... Estoy bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4074\t4134"
msgid "Suzuki-san?"
msgstr "¿Suzuki-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4170\t4207"
msgid "Little miss."
msgstr "Señorita."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4209\t4306"
msgid "Er, Haruka-chan."
msgstr "No, Haruka-chan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4323\t4417"
msgid "I 'preciate all ya done."
msgstr "Yo realmente aprecio todo lo que han hecho."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4466\t4558"
msgid "This here's goodbye for now."
msgstr "Pero es momento de que este tipo se vaya."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4560\t4643"
msgid "Ya might not see me for a while."
msgstr "Esto es el adiós, Haruka-chan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4685\t4768"
msgid "But it's just past three in the morning."
msgstr "¿Justo ahora? Son las tres de la mañana."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4780\t4852"
msgid "I don't got the time to wait."
msgstr "No hay tiempo que perder."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5260\t5468"
msgid "But you're still hurt really bad, Suzuki-san.\\nAt least stay and rest a bit more."
msgstr "Pero todavía estás herido, Suzuki-san.\\nDeberías tomarlo con más calma..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5508\t5583"
msgid "Can't do that, Haruka-chan."
msgstr "Nos vemos, Haruka-chan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5604\t5659"
msgid "Suzuki-san."
msgstr "Suzuki-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5741\t5809"
msgid "It ain't Suzuki."
msgstr "Y no soy Suzuki."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5812\t5936"
msgid "Name's Saejima.\\nTaiga Saejima."
msgstr "Mi nombre es Saejima.\\nTaiga Saejima."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5982\t6075"
msgid "Saejima... san?"
msgstr "¿Saejima... san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6078\t6252"
msgid "Ya got it. Tell Kiryu-san, too.\\nThat Saejima was here."
msgstr "Ah, cierto. Y dile a Kiryu-san también.\\nSaejima estuvo aquí."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6307\t6367"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6371\t6521"
msgid "I won't forget what ya did for me.\\nWe'll meet again someday."
msgstr "Nunca olvidaré la amabilidad que me dieron.\\nSeguramente nos volveremos a ver."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6530\t6612"
msgid "Pass that along, too."
msgstr "Por favor, dile eso también."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6647\t6700"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Lo haré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6712\t6751"
msgid "Later, then."
msgstr "Hasta luego."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7279\t7322"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "¡Tío Kaz!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7323\t7363"
msgid "Sorry I took so long."
msgstr "Ya estoy de vuelta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7364\t7413"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, Suzuki-san..."
msgstr "Tío Kaz, Suzuki-san..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7414\t7497"
msgid "I mean, Saejima-san just left!"
msgstr "Quiero decir, ¡Saejima-san acaba de irse!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7513\t7573"
msgid "Did he, now?"
msgstr "Ya veo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7581\t7654"
msgid "You're not gonna stop him?"
msgstr "¿Ya veo? ¿Estás bien con eso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7665\t7755"
msgid "There's no way he's fully recovered."
msgstr "Parece que sus heridas aún no se habían curado del todo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7756\t7840"
msgid "I'm sure he'll be just fine."
msgstr "Estoy seguro de que estará bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7863\t7975"
msgid "How are you so confident?"
msgstr "¿Estará bien?\\nBueno..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8006\t8096"
msgid "And what about the groceries, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "¿Tío Kaz, dónde están tus compras?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8097\t8157"
msgid "Oh, yeah."
msgstr "Bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8146\t8261"
msgid "Turns out you were right.\\nThe stores were all closed."
msgstr "Resulta que tenías razón.\\nTodas las tiendas están cerradas a esta hora."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8333\t8507"
msgid "I can't figure out how\\nyou grownups work sometimes."
msgstr "Bah, nunca entenderé lo que pasa\\npor la cabeza de los adultos."

